# Build output
#
# NOTE: `lib/` is deliberately NOT ignored here. This package is consumed by
# path (`dsh plugin --profile web add /path/to/dsh-cross-session`), and the
# harness serves the BUILT browser bundle: a clone without `lib/client.js` fails
# client activation loudly. Committing the build output keeps the repository
# directly mountable. Rebuild with `pnpm run build` after changing `src/`.

# Dependencies
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

# Tool caches
.eslintcache
*.tsbuildinfo
coverage/

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
